      "writtenOn": "2026-08-17T16:15:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That is not possible, in the disable path we get the hw_if_index from the flow itself, so it is always the one that was recorded by the underlying backend:\n```c\n  if (!enable)\n    hw_if_index \u003d f-\u003edriver_data.hw_if_index;\n```",
